[background arg="res://sprites/24062026133858-0001 (1).jpg" fade="0.0"]
join steak left
steak: Howdy there, partner!
- What's your name?
	character: Um, Hi! What’s your name?
	steak: Name’s Loin, Fastest gunslinger in the west. Ma full name is Sir Loin but my partners all said that sounded more like a knight. And so, it’s just Loin now. YEE HAW.
- Steak?
	character: You're a steak?
	steak: Yep! You know it partner! Fastest gunslinger in the west!
character: Right yea I see that…
character: [i] …The west…. What does he mean by the west???
steak: What sorta stuff ya into?
character: Erm.. I cook.
steak: Oh, that’s great! What are you making right now?
character: ...
character: ..You.
steak: Ah! How could I have stumbled on that one?
if {Entreevar} == "Brock":
	character: It’s fine!... It’s not like I was expecting you to be like that big buff gymbro.
	steak: I got some sand in me too! Hah!
else:
	character: It’s fine! It’s not like I was expecting you to be like that emotionless deadpan.
	steak: I will devote myself to be as delightful as I can be. Just like an Ace-High roller!
character: Why do you keep speaking like that?
steak: Like what? You startling my grooves.
character: Like THAT.,,
steak: Ah you mean my superior way of speaking.
character: Uh well.. Sure I guess…
steak: If ya don’t mind me asking ya but I got a strong gut feeling that you ain’t from around these parts are ya?
character: Well… Actually I am, this is where I work.
steak: Oh righty, Pardon my reach partner.
character: Yea that’s fine. Hm… what could we talk about..
- Dislike accent
	character: That way of speaking. It's kinda weird?
	steak: Oh, I'm doggone sorry, it’s just that from where I come from It’s normal to holler about like this. Plus I think it’s pretty solid.
	character: Yea.. right.... Could you try to speak normally?
	steak: You don’t like this way of speaking? I must educate ya!
	jump steakCOMFORT/
	set {SteakComfort} = "Comfort"
- Compliment accent
	character: The accent, I think it’s pretty neat.
	steak: Oh that’s lovely! Thanks for appreciating ma amazing accent that comes from the west.
	character: You got it partner!
	steak: I can teach ya' if you want!
	jump steakTEACHING/
	set {SteakTeach} = "Teach"
- Western movies?
	character: What about those western movies?
	steak: Yea you bet partner!
	character: What is your favourite western?
	steak: Hm... Maybe that good old western called “The unbeatable, the unhealthy, and the unsightly"?
	jump steakMOVIE/
	set {SteakMovie} = "Movie"